NPCs: {
	Alchemist: {
		DisplayName: Alchemist

		TownNPCMood: {
			Content: I'm content. My potions are bubbling nicely.
			NoHome: Where am I supposed to set up my cauldron? Out here?
			FarFromHome: My lab is too far away. What if something boils over?
			LoveSpace: Plenty of room for all my glassware. Wonderful!
			DislikeCrowded: Too many people. Someone is going to knock over a flask.
			HateCrowded: This is far too crowded! I can't brew like this!
			LikeBiome: The {BiomeName} is full of useful ingredients.
			DislikeBiome: The {BiomeName} is bad for my potions.
			LoveNPC: "{NPCName} brings me the freshest herbs. I adore her work!"
			LikeNPC: "{NPCName} understands the art of brewing."
			DislikeNPC: "{NPCName} keeps setting off explosions near my glassware."
			HateNPC: "{NPCName} keeps spilling dye into my potions!"
		}
	}
}

Bestiary: {
	Alchemist: A wandering brewer who settles down once the world's evil has been beaten back. The stronger the foes you defeat, the more potions he can brew.
}

Conditions: {
	DownedProvidence: After Providence has been defeated
	DownedDoG: After The Devourer of Gods has been defeated
}
